war with the White Walkers and the building

00:09:02.860 --> 00:09:04.390
of the Wall.

00:09:04.390 --> 00:09:07.050
See you guys tomorrow, high fives!

00:09:07.050 --> 00:09:09.690
Everybody go hug your dog if you have one.

